      {
        "id": 140193,
        "name": "silopolis",
        "username": "silopolis",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silopolis/{size}/2166_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-17T17:55:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That was my cognitive dissonance with him, too. I was thinking he'd be Green Lantern with energy boxing gloves and stuff, but he was more about support. Which is honestly fine, since I really enjoy support roles in this game. When I look around the table and see his constructs on everyone else, and I get to interrupt people to remind them that they get to use a power for free, or they get this much damage reduction, etc., it's a ton of fun. And if you bring Unity, too, you can basically protect the Lowest HP Hero for the entire game without much effort!</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:17:03.622Z",
