      {
        "id": 140194,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-17T19:47:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Get Adept out either or both copies of Rhapsody of Vigour along with your choice of other stuff. Get Cosmic to give him a Dynamic Siphon. Get people to start deliberately plinking the Siphon with one (or two, if you have both Rhapsodies out) point of damage every turn. Sit back while the Adept spends all game activating all of his everything :D.</p>",
