      {
        "id": 140195,
        "name": "Belle Sorciere",
        "username": "Belle_Sorciere",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/belle_sorciere/{size}/1982_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-17T22:41:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I was worried that I had too much support and not enough damage with both Argent Adept and Captain Cosmic, but it turned out that blowing up some constructs dealt some serious damage and I got to six projections under Dreamer fairly quickly thanks to that as well as Fanatic's reliable damage dealing.</p><p>Overall, I have yet to play a support character I don't like, although I do not always expect a certain character to be support before playing them.</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:17:03.755Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
