        "created_at": "2015-04-18T14:37:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I agree, we recently played a game with Legacy and the Adept in which the Adopt turned into a monster damage-dealer. I think we also had Prime Warden Fanatic, and we just kept calling on that double-buffed Scherzo…</p>",
