        "created_at": "2015-04-27T19:43:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A group of friends and I got together and played the Prime Warden team against Kraga Warfang, and it was one of the best matches I’ve had against her. Prime Warden Argent gets set up so much faster than regular Argent that by turn 3 he was tossing out plays and draws to Fanatic and Tempest consistently. As mentioned earlier, Fanatic’s power to play a card from top of deck then let Argent use a power (3 powers) led to endless hilarity. I wanna eventually do another PW game but against Advanced (and maybe Challenge) Akashbuta, see how well that goes.</p>",
